          %h2#Idea Idea
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conjecture"} conjectural
            %em geometric Langlands correspondence
            is meant to be an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/analogy"} analog
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/number+theory"} number theoretic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Langlands+correspondence"} Langlands correspondence
            under the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/function+field+analogy"} function field analogy
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/number+fields"} number fields
            replaced by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/function+fields"} function fields
            and further replaced by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+functions"} rational functions
            on
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+curves"} complex curves
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Weil+uniformization+theorem"} Weil uniformization theorem
            which expresses the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+stack+of+G-principal+bundles"} moduli stack of G-principal bundles
            over an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+curve"} algebraic curve
            as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+coset+space"} double coset space
            of various function rings (as discussed at
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a{:href => "moduli+space+of+bundles#OverCurvesAndTheLanglandsCorrespondence"} Moduli of bundles over curves
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Langlands+correspondence"} Langlands correspondence
            (for instance in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Artin+reciprocity+law"} Artin reciprocity law
            and in the definition of
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/automorphic+representations"} automorphic representations
          %div
