                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Sigma= \mathbb{P}^1
            (
            %a{:href => "#Lafforgue09"}> Lafforgue 09
            ).
          %p
            A refined formulation of the conjecture due to
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#ArinkinGaitsgory12"} Arinkin &amp; Gaitsgory 12
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ind-objects"} ind-objects
            of quasicoherent sheaves and refines
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+categories"} derived categories
            to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-categories"} stable (∞,1)-categories
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:maxsize => "2.4em", :minsize => "2.4em"} (
                  %mi Ind
                  %mo{:maxsize => "1.8em", :minsize => "1.8em"} (
